Business Name: Hill Country Web Works Location: Boerne, Texas Service Area: Boerne, Fair Oaks Ranch, Comfort, Kerrville, Fredericksburg, Bulverde, and surrounding Hill Country communities Business Structure: Sole proprietorship (with future option to transition to LLC) Founder: Robert Kane
